{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601060/extras/7f0f194d77d5134e0c9f9d6415241d9c.avif?t=1772708691\" width=1500 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a stool,  a mug, or just toilet paper and turn every tavern into a giant battle zone. Drink magical brews to unlock crazy powers that will make you stronger (but not necessarily wiser) and that will help you save the city. Eat some chicken wings, apples, and sausages to get your strength back: you\u2019re gonna need every bite to survive the next brawl!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two nights are the same! TaVRn\u2019s Takedown is highly replayable and you'll always find a new way to throw your mug on a new enemy\u2019s face... an immersive VR game for the best and the worst!\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601060/extras/59b207142b17fbeb1d2f975d8b5b357e.poster.avif?t=1772708691\" width=852 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601060/extras/59b207142b17fbeb1d2f975d8b5b357e.webm?t=1772708691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601060/extras/59b207142b17fbeb1d2f975d8b5b357e.mp4?t=1772708691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601060/extras/99b32832aabde3d00d8b521b62621d2e.avif?t=1772708691\" width=1500 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat epic bosses with a mix of strategy, courage\u2026 and probably a whole lot of improvisation.\u00a0  <br>Think fast but swing faster, and hope your last move isn\u2019t a total disaster.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After every run, unleash new powers that make you re-think your entire strategy and question every plan you ever had.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might not be the smartest fighter Mliuej has seen\u2026 but you\u2019ll definitely be the bravest and you might just become the greatest brawler the taverns have ever known!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601060/extras/662e3c80303cf6a7dd734b9848b2e1e7.poster.avif?t=1772708691\" width=852 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601060/extras/662e3c80303cf6a7dd734b9848b2e1e7.webm?t=1772708691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601060/extras/662e3c80303cf6a7dd734b9848b2e1e7.mp4?t=1772708691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601060/extras/212e260ec42c21058672cd50447bbfb7.avif?t=1772708691\" width=1500 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect absurd humor, spicy dialogue, some hidden references, and cult voice talent (Tim Downie, Tracy Wiles, Andrew Wincott, Luke Dale, Corin Nemec, Terrence Stone and more).\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601060/extras/747cf64f3b4d4b91808c67870979ab99.poster.avif?t=1772708691\" width=852 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601060/extras/747cf64f3b4d4b91808c67870979ab99.webm?t=1772708691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601060/extras/747cf64f3b4d4b91808c67870979ab99.mp4?t=1772708691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>COMING ON MARCH 26TH.\u00a0</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>WISHLIST NOW, PUNCH FACES LATER</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3601060?t=1772708691","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3601060?t=1772708691","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601060/2743be3a1eecad9bfb7a725ecc5db2f53a0769b2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772708691","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601060/2743be3a1eecad9bfb7a725ecc5db2f53a0769b2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772708691","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game features moderate violence in taverns with a cartoony setting, as well as crude language."},"detailed_description":"<h1>Launching March 26, 2026</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the worst taverns in the fantasy realm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TaVRn\u2019s Takedown</strong> is a wild\u00a0<strong>physics-driven VR tavern brawler</strong> where every fight spirals into glorious mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch ennemies.<br>Smash chairs.<br>Throw mugs.<br>Weaponize the entire tavern.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this ridiculous fantasy bar fight simulator, anything around you can become a weapon, and every brawl is a disaster waiting to happen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Wishlist now and join the tavern brawl on day one.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow us on social media for updates, gameplay clips, and\u00a0occasional signs of life from the devs.</p></p><br><h1>What to expect</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TaVRn\u2019s Takedown </strong> is a <strong>physics-driven VR tavern brawler</strong> set in a ridiculous fantasy world where every fight turns into total mayhem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Something strange is spreading through the land\u2019s taverns, turning ordinary <strong>bar fights</strong> into full-blown disasters.<br>Someone needs to restore order.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately\u2026 that someone is you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <strong>immersive hand-to-hand tavern brawls</strong> where <strong>anything around you can become a weapon</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punch humans, fight orcs, knock gobelins, &amp; take down other troublemakers in taverns that fall apart around you.<br>Smash chairs.<br>Throw mugs, toilet paper and your dignity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yeah... You\u2019re not some legendary hero destined to save the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re just a <strong>perfectly average adventurer</strong> who somehow ended up responsible for fixing this mess.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good luck with that!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601060/extras/7f0f194d77d5134e0c9f9d6415241d9c.avif?t=1772708691\" width=1500 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a stool,  a mug, or just toilet paper and turn every tavern into a giant battle zone. Drink magical brews to unlock crazy powers that will make you stronger (but not necessarily wiser) and that will help you save the city. Eat some chicken wings, apples, and sausages to get your strength back: you\u2019re gonna need every bite to survive the next brawl!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No two nights are the same! TaVRn\u2019s Takedown is highly replayable and you'll always find a new way to throw your mug on a new enemy\u2019s face... an immersive VR game for the best and the worst!\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601060/extras/59b207142b17fbeb1d2f975d8b5b357e.poster.avif?t=1772708691\" width=852 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601060/extras/59b207142b17fbeb1d2f975d8b5b357e.webm?t=1772708691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601060/extras/59b207142b17fbeb1d2f975d8b5b357e.mp4?t=1772708691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601060/extras/99b32832aabde3d00d8b521b62621d2e.avif?t=1772708691\" width=1500 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeat epic bosses with a mix of strategy, courage\u2026 and probably a whole lot of improvisation.\u00a0  <br>Think fast but swing faster, and hope your last move isn\u2019t a total disaster.\u00a0\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After every run, unleash new powers that make you re-think your entire strategy and question every plan you ever had.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You might not be the smartest fighter Mliuej has seen\u2026 but you\u2019ll definitely be the bravest and you might just become the greatest brawler the taverns have ever known!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601060/extras/662e3c80303cf6a7dd734b9848b2e1e7.poster.avif?t=1772708691\" width=852 height=316 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601060/extras/662e3c80303cf6a7dd734b9848b2e1e7.webm?t=1772708691\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601060/extras/662e3c80303cf6a7dd734b9848b2e1e7.mp4?t=1772708691\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601060/extras/212e260ec42c21058672cd50447bbfb7.avif?t=1772708691\" width=1500 height=160 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect absurd humor, spicy dialogue, some hidden references, and cult voice talent (Tim Downie, Tracy Wiles, Andrew Wincott, Luke Dale, Corin Nemec, Terrence Stone and more).\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic